OL,3,CCorrespondence with TV news presenter
OL,4,CNatalie Graham
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHO WERE THE MAIN PRESENTERS AND
OL,7,GREPORTERS WORKING ALONGSIDE YOU BACK
OL,8,GTHEN?
OL,10,F"At South East Today, I've worked with
OL,11,FLaurie Mayer, Bev Thompson, Giles
OL,12,FDilnot, Geoff Clarke, Julia George,
OL,13,FKaddy-Lee Preston, Rob Smith and Polly
OL,14,FEvans."
OL,23,EPub: 15-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
